acceptance_criteria: "pm context --for orient with a budget below its smallest feasible projection exits non-zero whether the budget is spelled --token-budget or --output-budget, in CLI, SDK and MCP, and every receipt in the envelope (budget_exceeded, context_intent and read_output) reports result_omitted true and within_budget false; The canonical --output-budget and the legacy --token-budget alias produce the same success, omission and exit status for the same value on the same corpus, proven by a spec that runs both spellings in JSON and TOON; Every restore_with or suggested retry an omission emits is executed by a spec against the same corpus and estimator and returns the requested result, or the envelope names an honest non-numeric alternative instead of a budget that cannot fit; The estimated_tokens that context_intent and read_output report for get --for inspect and list --for triage is computed over the complete serialized envelope including the receipts, and a spec asserts it is at least ceil(emitted UTF-8 bytes / 4) and that within_budget is false whenever the emitted output exceeds the budget; Negative control: reintroducing the intent-only estimate, or exit 0 on an omitted orient result, fails the specs above"
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: high
repro_steps: "In a fresh tracker with one claimed Task: pm context --for orient --token-budget 600 --json (exit 0, no context, contradictory receipts). pm context --for orient --output-budget 600 --json (exit 2). Run the emitted restore_with with --json (exit 2). pm get <id> --for inspect --token-budget 500 --json and pm list --for triage --token-budget 500 --limit 2 --json (receipt estimate below the emitted size)"
expected_result: "An omitted required result is unsuccessful on every transport and all receipts agree, canonical and legacy budgets behave identically, suggested retries work, and reported estimates cover the full emitted envelope"
actual_result: "context --for orient --token-budget 600 exits 0 with no context while read_output says within_budget true and result_omitted false, the emitted restore_with exits 2, and get/list intent receipts claim 385/376 tokens for outputs of about 538/529"
